        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: బందీ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బందీ — bandī — \"a captive; a hostage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దొంగలు ఇద్దరిని బందీలుగా పట్టుకున్నారు. doṅgalu iddarini bandīlugā paṭṭukunnāru. The robbers took two people captive."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: బందీలు, bandīlu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బందీగా పట్టుకో, to take captive."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "బందీ (bandī) is a loan from Persian bandī, \"a prisoner, a captive\", built on band, \"a bond\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
